            "text": "Starting 27 November, licensed gun dealers can run their own employees and job applicants through the FBI’s background-check system.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "text": "DOJ published the final “firearm handler check” rule in today’s Federal Register, four years after Congress authorized it. Dealers may use NICS voluntarily to screen current or prospective employees; nothing changes for buyers or carriers.",
